<title>FINLAND: Finnish Jan PPI falls 2.1 pct yr/yr -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Jan PPI falls 2.1 pct yr/yr -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industry's producer price index fell 0.1 percent in January on December, and it fell 2.1 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>			   Jan 1997    Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p>   Mth/Mth	     -0.1 pct    -0.2 pct	+0.2 pct</p>
<p>   Yr/Yr		 -2.1 pct    -1.8 pct	+3.1 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 6805 0245</p>
</text>
